{"Bute": [{"id": "BUte", "headword": "भूते", "headword_slp1": "BUte", "fold": "Bute", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "All the affixes to be treated of hereafter should be understood to come in the sense of past time.\n\nTerms: भूत", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भूते ३.२.८४", "३.२.८४", "३.२.८४ भूते"], "synonyms_slp1": ["BUte ३.२.८४", "३.२.८४", "३.२.८४ BUte"]}], "Butepi dfsyante": [{"id": "BUte'pi dfSyante", "headword": "भूतेऽपि दृश्यन्ते", "headword_slp1": "BUte'pi dfSyante", "fold": "Butepi dfsyante", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The उणादि affixes are seen also attached with the force of the past time.\n\nTerms: उणादि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भूतेऽपि दृश्यन्ते ३.३.२", "३.३.२", "३.३.२ भूतेऽपि दृश्यन्ते"], "synonyms_slp1": ["BUte'pi dfSyante ३.३.२", "३.३.२", "३.३.२ BUte'pi dfSyante"]}], "Bute ca": [{"id": "BUte ca", "headword": "भूते च", "headword_slp1": "BUte ca", "fold": "Bute ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And (where there is a reason for affixing लिङ् (Benedictive) , the affix ऌङ् (Conditional Future) is to be used, when the non-completion of the action is to be understood) if the sense is that of past time.\n\nTerms: ऌङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भूते च ३.३.१४०", "३.३.१४०", "३.३.१४० भूते च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["BUte ca ३.३.१४०", "३.३.१४०", "३.३.१४० BUte ca"]}], "Butapurve caraw": [{"id": "BUtapUrve caraw", "headword": "भूतपूर्वे चरट्", "headword_slp1": "BUtapUrve caraw", "fold": "Butapurve caraw", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix चर (with the feminine in ङीप्) comes after a प्रातिपदिक (Nominal Stem), the word retaining its detonation when the meaning is 'this had been before'.\n\nTerms: चर", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भूतपूर्वे चरट् ५.३.५३", "५.३.५३", "५.३.५३ भूतपूर्वे चरट्"], "synonyms_slp1":